    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be fæstenum.] [Ld] Gif frigman rihtfæsten abrece, gylde wíte oððe lahslite. Gif hit þeowman gedó, ðolie his hyde oððe hydgyldes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a freeman breaks a legally ordained fast, he shall pay a fine or lahslit. If a slave does so, he shall undergo the lash, or pay the fine in lieu thereof.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf friman rihtfæsten abrece, gylde wite uel lahslite. Gyf hit ðeowman gedó, ðolie his ... oððe hydgyldes.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
